<title>USA: Allied Waste Inds issues $240 mln in debt.</title>
<headline>Allied Waste Inds issues $240 mln in debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following 144A debt issue from waste collection and processing company Allied Waste Industries Inc was priced on Thursday, according to a high-yield market source.</p>
<p>Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co was lead manager.</p>
<p>BORROWER ALLIED WASTE INDUSTRIES INC</p>
<p>AMT $240 MLN	 COUPON 5-YR ZERO  MATURITY 6/01/2007</p>
<p>TYPE SNR DISC NOTE ISS PRICE 57.436  FIRST PAY DATE 6/01/2002</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S Caa   YIELD 11.30 PCT   PAY FREQ (5-YR ZERO)</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P B-PLUS    SPREAD 457 BP     CALLABLE NON-CALL 4.5 YR</p>
<p>NOTE: Three year equity call for 1/3 issue at 111.30</p>
<p>((--U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212 859-1672))</p>
</text>
